flowchart TB
    U[User Browser] --> FE[React SPA]
    FE -->|HTTPS JSON| API[FastAPI Backend cdm/backend]

    API --> Q[Query Service]
    API --> SS[Search Service]
    API --> TS[Timeline Service]
    API --> NLP[NLP Topic Service]

    Q --> DB[(SQLite/Postgres Read Models)]
    SS --> OS[(OpenSearch)]
    TS --> DB
    NLP --> OS
    NLP --> V[(Vector or Topic Store)]

    API --> CACHE[(Redis Cache)]

    subgraph Ingest and Index Pipeline
      ING[Ingest Jobs] --> NORM[Normalization]
      NORM --> IDX[Indexing Jobs]
      IDX --> OS
      NORM --> DB
    end

    ING -.offline pipeline output.-> API
